# The shotgun, fired at nobody until the magazine is empty (twelve shells, a shot
# a second) and left to reload: the first shell takes the weapon's animation of
# going in, and each of the others the one for loading, one after the other, until
# the magazine is full again. The trigger is pressed again while the weapon is part
# way through its shells (a reload is given up when the trigger is pressed), and
# once more when it has them all.
scenario shotgun_reload
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
weapon weapons/shotgun/shotgun
ticks 900
input 60 420 fire=1
input 500 530 fire=1
input 640 643 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
